# Each achievement is a three-line record: Steam ID, display name, and description.
# Records are separated by a blank line; lines beginning with # are comments.
# Every ID must have arts/achievements/ID.jpg and arts/achievements/_ID.jpg icons.
# Every achievement must be unlocked in code at the appropriate gameplay event using its exact Steam ID.
# Use concise verb-object PascalCase IDs, short Roman expressions or historical allusions for display names,
# and clear English descriptions that state the exact unlock condition and end with a period.

